  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inhambane and Niassa Solar Giraffes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Solar Giraffe by Carlos Morgado Foundation-FCM in Inhambane and Niassa aims to build a structure that supports a photovoltaic panel and a roof to create a rural community space that can be used to charge mobile phones, provide lighting or to air a radio broadcasts. The structure also allows a focal point for access to new information, social and economic interactions, and increased safety in communities.</narrative>
  </description>
